  "description": "The IEntityRepositoryMongo interface provides a repository abstraction for performing CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) and query operations on MongoDB collections. The interface provides synchronous and asynchronous methods for managing operations on a given type (T). This structure simplifies MongoDB operations while offering flexibility and extensibility.",
